  "description": "ULESOV crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P -6 2 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: 6(C6 H16 N1 1+),C66 H111 Gd7 O45 6-,5.67(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.939-3.956 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.98-113.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (iPr2NH2)6[Gd7(μ3-OH)3(CO3)6(O2CtBu)12]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
